+Key features implemented:
+- src/core/settings.py: Added `student_name` field to `AppConfig` and root `Settings`, implemented `window_title()` method for dynamic header generation, and added `save_student_name()` utility for persisting changes to YAML config.
+- config.example.yaml: Added `student_name` placeholder under the `app` section.
+- src/ui/app.py: Updated initialization logic to set `page.title` dynamically using `settings.window_title()` and integrated new SettingsView into the application layout.
+- src/ui/chat_view.py: Replaced static welcome banner text with the updated BSU FPMI-specific greeting template.
+- src/ui/settings_view.py: Created new module providing a UI form with `ft.TextField` for editing student full name and save button that updates config and window title instantly.
+- src/ui/layout.py: Extended `MainLayout` to include a third navigation destination ("Настройки") and corresponding container visibility toggling logic.
